Check: check_databases
References: mongod.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 4.4, 5.2; NIST SC-7, IA-2; ISO 8.5, 8.20; CE Firewalls, User access control

MongoDB takes unauthenticated connections from the network: no
authorization is configured, and it listens past localhost.
Anyone connecting has every privilege without a password. Enable
authorization and bind it to localhost where the network need not
reach it.
